{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Base"}], "prev": {"link": "../emoji-url/", "title": "EmojiURL"}, "next": {"link": "../encrypted-file/", "title": "EncryptedFile"}, "title": "EncryptedChat", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"encryptedchat\">\n<h1>EncryptedChat<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryptedchat\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.base.EncryptedChat\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.base.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedChat</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.base.EncryptedChat\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API base type.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Constructors:</dt><dd><p>This base type has 5 constructors available.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/encrypted-chat/#pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChat\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChat\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedChat</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/encrypted-chat-discarded/#pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatDiscarded\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatDiscarded\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedChatDiscarded</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/encrypted-chat-empty/#pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatEmpty\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatEmpty\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedChatEmpty</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/encrypted-chat-requested/#pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatRequested\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatRequested\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedChatRequested</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/encrypted-chat-waiting/#pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatWaiting\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.EncryptedChatWaiting\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedChatWaiting</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</dd>\n<dt>Functions:</dt><dd><p>This object can be returned by 2 functions.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../functions/messages/request-encryption/#pyrogram.raw.functions.messages.RequestEncryption\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.functions.messages.RequestEncryption\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">messages.RequestEncryption</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API function.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../functions/messages/accept-encryption/#pyrogram.raw.functions.messages.AcceptEncryption\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.functions.messages.AcceptEncryption\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">messages.AcceptEncryption</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API function.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</t